      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 608,
        "content": "## 🛠️ n8n Workflow Sale — Stripe Payment with Auto Delivery — SETUP\n\n### How it works\n\n1. The workflow is triggered by a Stripe checkout event.\n2. Payment data is normalized for further processing.\n3. Conditional logic checks if the payment is completed.\n4. The purchased workflow is fetched and its data processed.\n5. Sales data is logged to Google Sheets, and the workflow is exported and emailed to the buyer.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Configure Stripe credentials for the Stripe Checkout Trigger node.\n- [ ] Set up Google Sheets access for logging sales data.\n- [ ] Configure Gmail API credentials for sending emails.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust email templates and data transformation rules as per your business requirements."
